---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BookingForm from '../components/BookingForm.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Book Four Dogs Entertainment | Let’s Plan Your Night" description="Request Four Dogs trivia, Music Bingo, karaoke, wedding DJ, photo booth rentals, private, corporate, or original game entertainment.">
<section class="section alt booking-page"><div class="container booking-layout"><div class="booking-intro"><h1>Let’s plan your night.</h1><p class="lead">Your date. Your people. A Doggone Good Time.</p><p>Tell us what you’re planning and the kind of entertainment you have in mind. Four Dogs serves all of South Carolina.</p><h2>What happens next?</h2><p>We’ll talk through your event, the entertainment that fits, and availability. Sending a request starts the conversation and does not confirm a booking.</p><p>Prefer email?<br/><a href={`mailto:${site.bookingEmail}`}>{site.bookingEmail}</a></p><p>Looking for a night out instead?<br/><a href="/events/">Find an upcoming public event →</a></p></div><div class="booking-form-panel"><h2>Tell us about your event.</h2><p id="booking-required">Name, phone, email, and service are required. Share anything else you know so we can help.</p><BookingForm/></div></div></section>
</Base>
